{"id":"9bf75150bce95ccc","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-tensor.md","title":"Tensor Product","display":"df-tensor — Tensor Product","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-tensor","aliases":["58-df-tensor","Tensor Product"],"display":"df-tensor — Tensor Product","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-bilinear-map.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-tensor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-tensor</span><span>Tensor Product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tensor — Tensor Product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-module.md\">../batch13/58-df-module.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"175625664dfe6894\" href=\"?note=175625664dfe6894\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-bilinear-map.md\">../batch20/58-df-bilinear-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f54a13cf4872f4e\" href=\"?note=9f54a13cf4872f4e\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md\">../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite.md\">58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,R,Q,F,B\\in V\">\\(M,N,R,Q,F,B\\in V\\)</span>。固定环结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R=\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal R=\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle\\)</span>、右模结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=\\langle M,+_M,0_M,\\rho\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal M=\\langle M,+_M,0_M,\\rho\\rangle\\)</span> 及左模结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N=\\langle N,+_N,0_N,\\lambda\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal N=\\langle N,+_N,0_N,\\lambda\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\langle\\mathcal R,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\rangle\">\\(D=\\langle\\mathcal R,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\rangle\\)</span> 满足下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BalancedModuleData}_{58}(D,M,N,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{BalancedModuleData}_{58}(D,M,N,R)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TensorProductStructure}_S(Q,F,B,M,N,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TensorProductStructure}_S(Q,F,B,M,N,R)\\)</span> 保留六元接口，相对于上述固定结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>；多个调用不得重选这些运算。显式携带结构的接口为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q,F,B,M,N,R,D)\">\\(\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q,F,B,M,N,R,D)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\mathbb Z\\)</span> 使用通常整数环。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u+v\">\\(u+v\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"au\">\\(au\\)</span> 对整数值函数逐点计算；有限和包括空和零函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(u)=\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}u:u(x)\\ne0\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}(u)=\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}u:u(x)\\ne0\\}\\)</span>。所有二元运算用有序对编码自变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{\\mathrm{op}}\">\\(R^{\\mathrm{op}}\\)</span> 表示环记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R^{\\mathrm{op}},0_R,1_R\\rangle\">\\(\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R^{\\mathrm{op}},0_R,1_R\\rangle\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot_R^{\\mathrm{op}}(r,s)=s\\cdot_Rr\">\\(\\cdot_R^{\\mathrm{op}}(r,s)=s\\cdot_Rr\\)</span>；在载集参数位置只取其第一分量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>，不另造环载集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{\\mathbb Z}(X),e_X(x),\\operatorname{Span}_{\\mathbb Z,58}(S,X),\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(u,B,X),+_{Q,58},\\iota_{58}\">\\(F_{\\mathbb Z}(X),e_X(x),\\operatorname{Span}_{\\mathbb Z,58}(S,X),\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(u,B,X),+_{Q,58},\\iota_{58}\\)</span> 由下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\otimes_RN\">\\(M\\otimes_RN\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\otimes_Rn\">\\(m\\otimes_Rn\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_R(M,N)\">\\(B_R(M,N)\\)</span> 是相对于同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 的记号。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对有限记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle\">\\(\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_i\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle=a_i\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_i\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle=a_i\\)</span>。带结构记录的显式谓词中，运算及零元记号均缩写当前记录的对应分量；记录格式不满足时该谓词为假。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9f54a13cf4872f4e\" href=\"?note=9f54a13cf4872f4e\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md\">../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BalancedModuleData}_{58}(D,M,N,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists +_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_M,0_M,\\rho,+_N,0_N,\\lambda\\;\\bigl[\nD=\\langle\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle,\\langle M,+_M,0_M,\\rho\\rangle,\\langle N,+_N,0_N,\\lambda\\rangle\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(M,+_M)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(N,+_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land0_M\\in M\\land0_N\\in N\\land\\forall m\\in M\\;(m+_M0_M=m)\n\\land\\forall n\\in N\\;(n+_N0_N=n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\rho\\in M^{M\\times R}\\land\\lambda\\in N^{R\\times N}\n\\land\\forall m,m&#39;\\in M\\;\\forall n,n&#39;\\in N\\;\\forall r,s\\in R\\;\\bigl(\n\\rho(m+_Mm&#39;,r)=\\rho(m,r)+_M\\rho(m&#39;,r)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\rho(m,r+_Rs)=\\rho(m,r)+_M\\rho(m,s)\n\\land\\rho(\\rho(m,r),s)=\\rho(m,r\\cdot_Rs)\\land\\rho(m,1_R)=m\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\lambda(r,n+_Nn&#39;)=\\lambda(r,n)+_N\\lambda(r,n&#39;)\n\\land\\lambda(r+_Rs,n)=\\lambda(r,n)+_N\\lambda(s,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\lambda(r,\\lambda(s,n))=\\lambda(r\\cdot_Rs,n)\\land\\lambda(1_R,n)=n\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BalancedModuleData}_{58}(D,M,N,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists +_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_M,0_M,\\rho,+_N,0_N,\\lambda\\;\\bigl[\nD=\\langle\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle,\\langle M,+_M,0_M,\\rho\\rangle,\\langle N,+_N,0_N,\\lambda\\rangle\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(M,+_M)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(N,+_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land0_M\\in M\\land0_N\\in N\\land\\forall m\\in M\\;(m+_M0_M=m)\n\\land\\forall n\\in N\\;(n+_N0_N=n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\rho\\in M^{M\\times R}\\land\\lambda\\in N^{R\\times N}\n\\land\\forall m,m&#39;\\in M\\;\\forall n,n&#39;\\in N\\;\\forall r,s\\in R\\;\\bigl(\n\\rho(m+_Mm&#39;,r)=\\rho(m,r)+_M\\rho(m&#39;,r)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\rho(m,r+_Rs)=\\rho(m,r)+_M\\rho(m,s)\n\\land\\rho(\\rho(m,r),s)=\\rho(m,r\\cdot_Rs)\\land\\rho(m,1_R)=m\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\lambda(r,n+_Nn&#39;)=\\lambda(r,n)+_N\\lambda(r,n&#39;)\n\\land\\lambda(r+_Rs,n)=\\lambda(r,n)+_N\\lambda(s,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\lambda(r,\\lambda(s,n))=\\lambda(r\\cdot_Rs,n)\\land\\lambda(1_R,n)=n\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\nF_{\\mathbb Z}(X)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in\\mathbb Z^X:|\\operatorname{supp}(u)|&lt;\\omega\\},\\qquad\nx\\in X\\to e_X(x)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle y,\\mathbf1_{\\{x\\}}(y)\\rangle:y\\in X\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf1_{\\{x\\}}(y)=\\begin{cases}1&amp;y=x,\\\\0&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\\\\nS\\subseteq F_{\\mathbb Z}(X)\\to\\operatorname{Span}_{\\mathbb Z,58}(S,X)\n\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\sum_{i&lt;q}a_i u_i:q&lt;\\omega,\\ a\\in\\mathbb Z^q,\\ u\\in S^q\\right\\},\\\\\nu\\in F_{\\mathbb Z}(X)\\land B\\subseteq F_{\\mathbb Z}(X)\\to\n\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(u,B,X)\\coloneqq\\{u+b:b\\in B\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\nF_{\\mathbb Z}(X)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in\\mathbb Z^X:|\\operatorname{supp}(u)|&lt;\\omega\\},\\qquad\nx\\in X\\to e_X(x)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle y,\\mathbf1_{\\{x\\}}(y)\\rangle:y\\in X\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf1_{\\{x\\}}(y)=\\begin{cases}1&amp;y=x,\\\\0&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\\\\nS\\subseteq F_{\\mathbb Z}(X)\\to\\operatorname{Span}_{\\mathbb Z,58}(S,X)\n\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\sum_{i&lt;q}a_i u_i:q&lt;\\omega,\\ a\\in\\mathbb Z^q,\\ u\\in S^q\\right\\},\\\\\nu\\in F_{\\mathbb Z}(X)\\land B\\subseteq F_{\\mathbb Z}(X)\\to\n\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(u,B,X)\\coloneqq\\{u+b:b\\in B\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BalancedModuleData}_{58}(D,M,N,R)\\to\n\\mathrm{TensorRelations}_{58}(D,M,N,R)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{e_{M\\times N}(m+_Mm&#39;,n)-e_{M\\times N}(m,n)-e_{M\\times N}(m&#39;,n):m,m&#39;\\in M,n\\in N\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{e_{M\\times N}(m,n+_Nn&#39;)-e_{M\\times N}(m,n)-e_{M\\times N}(m,n&#39;):m\\in M,n,n&#39;\\in N\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{e_{M\\times N}(\\rho(m,r),n)-e_{M\\times N}(m,\\lambda(r,n)):m\\in M,n\\in N,r\\in R\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BalancedModuleData}_{58}(D,M,N,R)\\to\n\\mathrm{TensorRelations}_{58}(D,M,N,R)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{e_{M\\times N}(m+_Mm&#39;,n)-e_{M\\times N}(m,n)-e_{M\\times N}(m&#39;,n):m,m&#39;\\in M,n\\in N\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{e_{M\\times N}(m,n+_Nn&#39;)-e_{M\\times N}(m,n)-e_{M\\times N}(m,n&#39;):m\\in M,n,n&#39;\\in N\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{e_{M\\times N}(\\rho(m,r),n)-e_{M\\times N}(m,\\lambda(r,n)):m\\in M,n\\in N,r\\in R\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q,F,B,M,N,R,D)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BalancedModuleData}_{58}(D,M,N,R)\\land F=F_{\\mathbb Z}(M\\times N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land B=\\operatorname{Span}_{\\mathbb Z,58}(\\mathrm{TensorRelations}_{58}(D,M,N,R),M\\times N)\n\\land Q=\\{\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(u,B,M\\times N):u\\in F\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q,F,B,M,N,R,D)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{BalancedModuleData}_{58}(D,M,N,R)\\land F=F_{\\mathbb Z}(M\\times N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land B=\\operatorname{Span}_{\\mathbb Z,58}(\\mathrm{TensorRelations}_{58}(D,M,N,R),M\\times N)\n\\land Q=\\{\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(u,B,M\\times N):u\\in F\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q,F,B,M,N,R,D)\\to\\bigl[\n+_{Q,58}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(u,B,M\\times N),\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(v,B,M\\times N)\\rangle,\n\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(u+v,B,M\\times N)\\rangle:u,v\\in F\\},\\\\\n\\iota_{58}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle m,n\\rangle,\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(e_{M\\times N}(m,n),B,M\\times N)\\rangle:m\\in M,n\\in N\\}\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q,F,B,M,N,R,D)\\to\\bigl[\n+_{Q,58}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(u,B,M\\times N),\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(v,B,M\\times N)\\rangle,\n\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(u+v,B,M\\times N)\\rangle:u,v\\in F\\},\\\\\n\\iota_{58}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle m,n\\rangle,\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(e_{M\\times N}(m,n),B,M\\times N)\\rangle:m\\in M,n\\in N\\}\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TensorProductStructure}_S(Q,F,B,M,N,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q,F,B,M,N,R,D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TensorProductStructure}_S(Q,F,B,M,N,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q,F,B,M,N,R,D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\nB_R(M,N)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Span}_{\\mathbb Z,58}(\\mathrm{TensorRelations}_{58}(D,M,N,R),M\\times N),\\\\\nM\\otimes_RN\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(u,B_R(M,N),M\\times N):u\\in F_{\\mathbb Z}(M\\times N)\\},\\\\\n(m,n)\\in M\\times N\\to m\\otimes_Rn\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(e_{M\\times N}(m,n),B_R(M,N),M\\times N).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\nB_R(M,N)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Span}_{\\mathbb Z,58}(\\mathrm{TensorRelations}_{58}(D,M,N,R),M\\times N),\\\\\nM\\otimes_RN\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(u,B_R(M,N),M\\times N):u\\in F_{\\mathbb Z}(M\\times N)\\},\\\\\n(m,n)\\in M\\times N\\to m\\otimes_Rn\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(e_{M\\times N}(m,n),B_R(M,N),M\\times N).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留自由阿贝尔群模平衡关系子群的原构造及六元接口；补全有限支撑模型、基元、子群生成、陪集、加法和纯张量。所有环及模运算是固定环境参数，不能逐次任意选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lang, Algebra, Chapter XVI</li>\n<li>Mac Lane, Homology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-module.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-module.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-bilinear-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"175625664dfe6894","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-bilinear-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f54a13cf4872f4e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"9f54a13cf4872f4e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}$ 取 [[../batch17/58-df-abelian-group.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N,R,Q,F,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R=\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M=\\langle M,+_M,0_M,\\rho\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N=\\langle N,+_N,0_N,\\lambda\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\langle\\mathcal R,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BalancedModuleData}_{58}(D,M,N,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TensorProductStructure}_S(Q,F,B,M,N,R)","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q,F,B,M,N,R,D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"u+v","display":false},{"tex":"au","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{supp}(u)=\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}u:u(x)\\ne0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R^{\\mathrm{op}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R^{\\mathrm{op}},0_R,1_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot_R^{\\mathrm{op}}(r,s)=s\\cdot_Rr","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"F_{\\mathbb Z}(X),e_X(x),\\operatorname{Span}_{\\mathbb Z,58}(S,X),\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(u,B,X),+_{Q,58},\\iota_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"M\\otimes_RN","display":false},{"tex":"m\\otimes_Rn","display":false},{"tex":"B_R(M,N)","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pr}_i\\langle a_0,\\ldots,a_{r-1}\\rangle=a_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BalancedModuleData}_{58}(D,M,N,R)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists +_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_M,0_M,\\rho,+_N,0_N,\\lambda\\;\\bigl[\nD=\\langle\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle,\\langle M,+_M,0_M,\\rho\\rangle,\\langle N,+_N,0_N,\\lambda\\rangle\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{Ring}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\n\\land\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(M,+_M)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(N,+_N)\\\\\n&\\land0_M\\in M\\land0_N\\in N\\land\\forall m\\in M\\;(m+_M0_M=m)\n\\land\\forall n\\in N\\;(n+_N0_N=n)\\\\\n&\\land\\rho\\in M^{M\\times R}\\land\\lambda\\in N^{R\\times N}\n\\land\\forall m,m'\\in M\\;\\forall n,n'\\in N\\;\\forall r,s\\in R\\;\\bigl(\n\\rho(m+_Mm',r)=\\rho(m,r)+_M\\rho(m',r)\\\\\n&\\land\\rho(m,r+_Rs)=\\rho(m,r)+_M\\rho(m,s)\n\\land\\rho(\\rho(m,r),s)=\\rho(m,r\\cdot_Rs)\\land\\rho(m,1_R)=m\\\\\n&\\land\\lambda(r,n+_Nn')=\\lambda(r,n)+_N\\lambda(r,n')\n\\land\\lambda(r+_Rs,n)=\\lambda(r,n)+_N\\lambda(s,n)\\\\\n&\\land\\lambda(r,\\lambda(s,n))=\\lambda(r\\cdot_Rs,n)\\land\\lambda(1_R,n)=n\\bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\nF_{\\mathbb Z}(X)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in\\mathbb Z^X:|\\operatorname{supp}(u)|<\\omega\\},\\qquad\nx\\in X\\to e_X(x)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle y,\\mathbf1_{\\{x\\}}(y)\\rangle:y\\in X\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf1_{\\{x\\}}(y)=\\begin{cases}1&y=x,\\\\0&y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\\\\nS\\subseteq F_{\\mathbb Z}(X)\\to\\operatorname{Span}_{\\mathbb Z,58}(S,X)\n\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\sum_{i<q}a_i u_i:q<\\omega,\\ a\\in\\mathbb Z^q,\\ u\\in S^q\\right\\},\\\\\nu\\in F_{\\mathbb Z}(X)\\land B\\subseteq F_{\\mathbb Z}(X)\\to\n\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(u,B,X)\\coloneqq\\{u+b:b\\in B\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BalancedModuleData}_{58}(D,M,N,R)\\to\n\\mathrm{TensorRelations}_{58}(D,M,N,R)\\coloneqq{}&\n\\{e_{M\\times N}(m+_Mm',n)-e_{M\\times N}(m,n)-e_{M\\times N}(m',n):m,m'\\in M,n\\in N\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{e_{M\\times N}(m,n+_Nn')-e_{M\\times N}(m,n)-e_{M\\times N}(m,n'):m\\in M,n,n'\\in N\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{e_{M\\times N}(\\rho(m,r),n)-e_{M\\times N}(m,\\lambda(r,n)):m\\in M,n\\in N,r\\in R\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q,F,B,M,N,R,D)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{BalancedModuleData}_{58}(D,M,N,R)\\land F=F_{\\mathbb Z}(M\\times N)\\\\\n&\\land B=\\operatorname{Span}_{\\mathbb Z,58}(\\mathrm{TensorRelations}_{58}(D,M,N,R),M\\times N)\n\\land Q=\\{\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(u,B,M\\times N):u\\in F\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q,F,B,M,N,R,D)\\to\\bigl[\n+_{Q,58}&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(u,B,M\\times N),\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(v,B,M\\times N)\\rangle,\n\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(u+v,B,M\\times N)\\rangle:u,v\\in F\\},\\\\\n\\iota_{58}&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\langle m,n\\rangle,\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(e_{M\\times N}(m,n),B,M\\times N)\\rangle:m\\in M,n\\in N\\}\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TensorProductStructure}_S(Q,F,B,M,N,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q,F,B,M,N,R,D).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\nB_R(M,N)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Span}_{\\mathbb Z,58}(\\mathrm{TensorRelations}_{58}(D,M,N,R),M\\times N),\\\\\nM\\otimes_RN\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(u,B_R(M,N),M\\times N):u\\in F_{\\mathbb Z}(M\\times N)\\},\\\\\n(m,n)\\in M\\times N\\to m\\otimes_Rn\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Coset}_{58}(e_{M\\times N}(m,n),B_R(M,N),M\\times N).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":5455,"backlinks":[{"id":"004e048b3416923c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"df67b9abe6db5f2c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2e365ef412503e95","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4c849eff8e22e2c7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5639c532f6329124","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"e